> I have a PWS500au, and i'm trying to get a microphone hooked up to it.
> If i plug the mic on the side, or in back, i can hear the recording
> through the speakers, but whenever i go to actually record something
> wiht an app (like cat, or wavr), i get a blank wav file.  I've checked
> the volumes, and they're set properly.

If you are using the ALSA drivers (don't know about OSS) you have to turn on 
capturing on the right line.  Run alsamixer and press space on the line you 
want to capture (in your case, probably either Mic or Line).

